{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09813","headline":"早春陪崔中丞同泛浣花谿宴 · 岑参","name":"早春陪崔中丞同泛浣花谿宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旌节临谿口，塞郊陡觉暄。\n红亭移酒席，画舸逗江村。\n云带歌声扬，风飘舞袖翻。\n花间催秉烛，川上欲黄昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}